{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2023-08/1060471/block/singleImage/3249444/wm/%E6%99%AF%E6%9E%97%E9%82%A8_0.jpeg?updatedAt=1793067846\"/><figcaption>將軍澳景林邨發生墮樓事件(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>將軍澳景林邨發生墮樓事件。今日(27日)凌晨零時許，警方接獲途人報案，指一名男子倒臥在景櫚樓對開，懷疑他從高處墮下。 救援人員接報到場，證實36歲姓周男子已死亡。警方初步調查相信，事主從大廈一處梯間墮下，現場未有檢獲遺書，死因有待驗屍後確定。據悉事主曾透露出現金錢問題，案件列作有人從高處墮下。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T03:41:40.866985+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":166,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T02:24:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:34.649163+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T03:38:17.620416+00:00","content_hash":"ec9734f5d6a0e00619b02494dc01e99cb49a0143aedd7302fe6b1d92d7e8dc35","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}